00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.015
TO THESE EXTRAORDINARY SESSIONS,

00:21:57.082 --> 00:21:59.117
WHICH THIS IS MY SECOND IN TWO

00:21:59.184 --> 00:22:02.421
YEARS. AND TAKE BACK OUR POWER

00:22:02.487 --> 00:22:04.289
AS A STATE LEGISLATURE,

00:22:04.356 --> 00:22:07.059
INDEPENDENT OF THE GOVERNOR.

00:22:07.125 --> 00:22:10.529
THIS BILL IS UNACCEPTABLE. WE

00:22:10.595 --> 00:22:12.330
KNOW WE CAN DO BETTER. WE MUST

00:22:12.397 --> 00:22:13.932
DO BETTER BY BEING HERE TODAY. I

00:22:13.999 --> 00:22:17.202
KNOW YOUR GOAL IS TO DO BETTER.

00:22:17.269 --> 00:22:20.338
SO I RESPECTFULLY ASK FOR A NO

00:22:20.405 --> 00:22:21.573
VOTE AS WE MOVE FORWARD. THANK

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:22.841
YOU. THANK YOU. SENATOR. ANY

00:22:22.908 --> 00:22:23.909
FURTHER DISCUSSION OR DEBATE

