MEMBERS? SENATOR GROVE, I SEE

00:22:25.777 --> 00:22:29.247
YOUR HAND. ANYBODY ELSE WANT TO

00:22:29.314 --> 00:22:31.616
GET THEIR HAND UP SO I CAN MAKE

00:22:31.683 --> 00:22:33.552
SURE I HAVE THEM IN THE QUEUE? I

00:22:33.618 --> 00:22:34.820
SEE. GOT IT. OKAY, SENATOR

00:22:34.886 --> 00:22:36.621
GROVE, THE FLOOR IS YOURS. THANK

00:22:36.688 --> 00:22:37.489
YOU, MR. PRESIDENT. AND

00:22:37.556 --> 00:22:38.523
COLLEAGUES, I RISE IN OPPOSITION

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:40.292
OF THIS BILL, WHICH INTENDS TO

00:22:40.358 --> 00:22:42.194
REDUCE THE GAS PRICE VOLATILITY.

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:43.462
BUT I COMPEL YOU TO UNDERSTAND

00:22:43.528 --> 00:22:45.564
THAT IT WILL DO JUST THE

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:48.366
OPPOSITE. ON ONE HAND, THIS BILL

00:22:48.433 --> 00:22:49.534
IS EXACTLY WHAT THE PUBLIC HAS

00:22:49.601 --> 00:22:52.304
COME TO EXPECT WITH US AS A

00:22:52.370 --> 00:22:54.339
LEGISLATIVE BODY. WE ROUTINELY

00:22:54.406 --> 00:22:57.442
KICK COMPLICATED ISSUES TO OUR

00:22:57.509 --> 00:22:59.811
UNELECTED, BUREAUCRATIC AGENCIES

00:22:59.878 --> 00:23:03.248
AND GIVE THEM FULL AUTHORITY TO

00:23:03.315 --> 00:23:04.282
DO IMPLEMENT REGULATIONS THAT

00:23:04.349 --> 00:23:06.284
WILL BE HARMFUL TO OUR

00:23:06.351 --> 00:23:07.385
CONSTITUENTS. ON THE OTHER HAND,

00:23:07.452 --> 00:23:11.089
THE BILL IS WHAT THE PUBLIC,

00:23:11.156 --> 00:23:12.390
LIKE I SAID, HAS COME TO EXPECT.

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:13.992
AND IN RESPECT TO THIS BILL, IT

00:23:14.059 --> 00:23:16.628
REALLY DOESN'T DO A WHOLE LOT

00:23:16.695 --> 00:23:17.896
SINCE MOST OF THE SPECIFICS WILL

00:23:17.963 --> 00:23:19.564
BE DETERMINED AT A LATER DATE BY

00:23:19.631 --> 00:23:20.766
THE CALIFORNIA ENERGY COMMISSION.

00:23:20.832 --> 00:23:21.933
BUT ON THE OTHER HAND, THE BROAD

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:22.834
REGULATORY AUTHORITY THIS BILL

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:24.035
IS GIVING THE CALIFORNIA ENERGY

00:23:24.102 --> 00:23:26.471
COMMISSION WILL UNDOUBTEDLY

00:23:26.538 --> 00:23:27.105
INCREASE PRICES TO THE MILLIONS

00:23:27.172 --> 00:23:28.573
