00:25:47.712 --> 00:25:48.847
ARABIA, AND THEY COME ACROSS OUR

00:25:48.914 --> 00:25:51.049
ECOSYSTEM. THEY COME TO OUR

00:25:51.116 --> 00:25:52.217
