NOT LETTING CARB REGULATE THE

00:27:36.721 --> 00:27:39.724
INDUSTRY TO A POINT WHERE THEY

00:27:39.791 --> 00:27:40.859
HAVE TO INCREASE FUEL PRICES.

00:27:40.925 --> 00:27:42.994
IT'S NOT ANY PART OF THAT. YOU

00:27:43.061 --> 00:27:44.162
WON'T ADMIT TO THAT. YOU WON'T

00:27:44.229 --> 00:27:45.163
ADMIT TO THE SUBSIDIZED GREEN

00:27:45.230 --> 00:27:46.798
ENERGY TECHNOLOGY THAT GOES, AND

