00:31:15.473 --> 00:31:17.508
ACTION MUST BENEFIT CONSUMERS,

00:31:17.575 --> 00:31:21.145
MUST BENEFIT CONSUMERS SO THEY

00:31:21.212 --> 00:31:23.014
