AMONG OTHER THINGS, THE BILL

00:31:27.185 --> 00:31:28.853
REQUIRES THAT ANY REGULATION

00:31:28.920 --> 00:31:29.988
ADOPTED MUST, AND I QUOTE,

00:31:30.054 --> 00:31:32.557
PROTECT THE HEALTH AND SAFETY OF

00:31:32.624 --> 00:31:35.026
EMPLOYEES, LOCAL COMMUNITIES AND

00:31:35.093 --> 00:31:36.227
THE PUBLIC. END OF QUOTE. THAT'S

00:31:36.294 --> 00:31:38.329
THE FINDING THAT THEY MUST MEET

00:31:38.396 --> 00:31:40.898
REGULATORS MUST DEMONSTRATE THAT

00:31:40.965 --> 00:31:43.668
